OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 12, campaigns for healthier
OL,4,Ahospital food
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old girl who spent time in
OL,7,Fhospital battling an aggressive form of
OL,8,Fcancer has launched a petition calling
OL,9,Ffor improvements to the food dished up
OL,10,Fto patients.
OL,12,FAudrina, from Derby, said despite
OL,13,Freceiving excellent care from doctors
OL,14,Fand nurses during her treatment, the
OL,15,Ffood she was served often left her
OL,16,Fdisappointed.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
