OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 12, campaigns for healthier
OL,4,Ahospital food
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe described the meals as tasteless
OL,7,Fand lacking in important nutrients she
OL,8,Fbelieves patients need while
OL,9,Frecovering. Now she is urging the UK
OL,10,Fgovernment to take action to raise
OL,11,Fstandards.
OL,13,FThe Department for Health and Social
OL,14,FCare said it welcomed ideas from
OL,15,Fcampaigners like Audrina on how
OL,16,Fhospital food can be improved.
